<ns0:section xmlns:ns0="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id991e8d6c-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc" identifier="/us/usc/t42/s2000g–3"><ns0:num value="2000g–3">§ 2000g–3.</ns0:num><ns0:heading> Reports to Congress</ns0:heading><ns0:content>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">Subject to the provisions of sections 2000a–4 and 2000g–2(b) of this title, the Director shall, on or before January 31 of each year, submit to the Congress a report of the activities of the Service during the preceding fiscal year.</ns0:p>
</ns0:content><ns0:sourceCredit id="id991e8d6d-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc">(<ns0:ref href="/us/pl/88/352/tX/s1004">Pub. L. 88–352, title X, § 1004</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1964-07-02">July 2, 1964</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/78/267">78 Stat. 267</ns0:ref>.)</ns0:sourceCredit>
</ns0:section>
